{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "858404d1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Simulasi Monte Carlo dan Integrasi Monte Carlo"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "3c125180",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Nama: T. M. Aldine Al Kautsar\n",
    "\n",
    "NIM: 20926005"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "74b03369",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Estimasi $\\pi$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "286078af",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Peluang suatu titik jatuh di dalam lingkaran berjari-jari $1$ sama dengan rasio luasnya, yaitu $p = \\frac{\\pi}{4}$."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "a5112a22",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "from matplotlib import pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "x_circle = np.arange(-1, 1, 1e-5)\n",
    "y1_circle = np.sqrt(1 - x_circle**2)\n",
    "y2_circle = -np.sqrt(1 - x_circle**2)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.plot(x_circle, y1_circle, color='orange')\n",
    "plt.plot(x_circle, y2_circle, color='orange')\n",
    "plt.xlim(-1.5, 1.5)\n",
    "plt.ylim(-1.5, 1.5)\n",
    "plt.axis('equal')\n",
    "plt.title('$x^2$ + $y^2$ = 1')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8a51cfae",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Sebarkan N titik secara seragam di dalam persegi $[-1, 1] \\times [-1, 1]$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "7042980f",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x = []\n",
    "y = []\n",
    "\n",
    "N = 10000\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(N):\n",
    "    x.append(np.random.uniform(-1,1))\n",
    "    y.append(np.random.uniform(-1,1))\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.scatter(x, y, s=1)\n",
    "plt.plot(x_circle, y1_circle, color='orange')\n",
    "plt.plot(x_circle, y2_circle, color='orange')\n",
    "plt.title('N $[-1, 1]$ $\\\\times$ $[-1, 1]$')\n",
    "plt.axis('equal')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "172f0eab",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$N_{in}$ titik yang memenuhi $x_i^2 + y_i^2 = 1$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "de2238a0",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "N_in = [[], []]\n",
    "N_total = [x, y]\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(N):\n",
    "    if x[i]**2 + y[i]**2 < 1:\n",
    "        N_in[0].append(x[i])\n",
    "        N_in[1].append(y[i])\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.scatter(N_in[0], N_in[1], s=1)\n",
    "plt.plot(x_circle, y1_circle, color='orange')\n",
    "plt.plot(x_circle, y2_circle, color='orange')\n",
    "plt.title('$N_{in}$')\n",
    "plt.axis('equal')\n",
    "plt.show()\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b1b958f8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Jika terdapat $N_{in}$ titik jatuh di dalam lingkaran, maka:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\pi = 4\\frac{N_{in}}{N}$$\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "a056dd4b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Pi Approx ≈ 3.1652\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "pi = 4*(len(N_in[0])/len(N_total[0]))\n",
    "print('Pi Approx ≈', pi)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9742c335",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Hitung estimasi $\\pi$ untuk $N$ dari $10^2$ sampai $10^7$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 6,
   "id": "d164d472",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json": {
       "model_id": "9748e920de3b4137a4e8a59f0d0672ba",
       "version_major": 2,
       "version_minor": 0
      },
      "text/plain": [
       "  0%|          | 0/100000 [00:00<?, ?it/s]"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def pi_estimate(N):\n",
    "    x = []\n",
    "    y = []\n",
    "    x_in = []\n",
    "    y_in = []\n",
    "\n",
    "    for i in range(N):\n",
    "        x.append(np.random.uniform(-1,1))\n",
    "        y.append(np.random.uniform(-1,1))\n",
    "        if x[i]**2 + y[i]**2 < 1:\n",
    "            x_in.append(x[i])\n",
    "            y_in.append(y[i])\n",
    "\n",
    "    return len(x_in), len(x)\n",
    "\n",
    "y = []\n",
    "x = range(10, 10000000, 100)\n",
    "n = 100\n",
    "x_in_list = []\n",
    "x_list = []\n",
    "\n",
    "from tqdm.notebook import tqdm\n",
    "for i in tqdm(range(len(x))):\n",
    "    temp = pi_estimate(100)\n",
    "    x_in_list.append(temp[0])\n",
    "    x_list.append(temp[1])\n",
    "    approx =  4 * (sum(x_in_list) + temp[0]) / (sum(x_list) + temp[1])\n",
    "    y.append(approx)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "552d6188",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Plot estimasi $\\pi$ terhadap $N$ bersama nilai $\\pi$ sebenarnya"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 7,
   "id": "29dfc22c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "plt.plot(x, y)\n",
    "plt.title('N vs Pi approximation')\n",
    "plt.xlabel('N')\n",
    "plt.ylabel('Pi approx')\n",
    "plt.hlines(np.pi, 0, 10000000, linestyles='--', colors='orange')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dbbcb537",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Integrasi satu dimensi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "80adcb79",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Hitung:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\int_0^\\pi \\sin{x} dx$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Nilai analitik = 2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "d01058de",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Hitung $I$ dengan metode hit-or-miss dan metode rata-rata untuk $N = 10^4$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 8,
   "id": "fa925ba9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x = np.arange(0, np.pi, 0.01)\n",
    "y = np.sin(x)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.plot(x, y, color='orange')\n",
    "plt.title('$y = sin(x)$')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "85c06517",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Distribusikan $N$ titik $(x_i, y_i)$ secara seragam di dalam kotak $[a, b] \\times [0, fmax]$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 9,
   "id": "254176df",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x_point = []\n",
    "y_point = []\n",
    "\n",
    "N = 10000\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(N):\n",
    "    x_point.append(np.random.uniform(0,np.pi))\n",
    "    y_point.append(np.random.uniform(0,max(y)))\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.scatter(x_point, y_point, s=1)\n",
    "plt.plot(x, y, color='orange')\n",
    "plt.title('$N [a, b] \\\\times [0, f_{max}]$')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5569e33d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$N_{in}$ titik yang memenuhi $y_i < f(x_i)$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 10,
   "id": "e8da5042",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x_in = []\n",
    "y_in = []\n",
    "\n",
    "def f(x):\n",
    "    return np.sin(x)\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(N):\n",
    "    if y_point[i] < f(x_point[i]):\n",
    "        x_in.append(x_point[i])\n",
    "        y_in.append(y_point[i])\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.scatter(x_in, y_in, s=1)\n",
    "plt.plot(x, f(x), color='orange')\n",
    "plt.title('$N_{in}: y_i < f(x_i)$')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "150ad397",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Metode hit-or-miss"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4f19c9e7",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Jika terdapat $N_{in}$ titik yang memenuhi $yi < f(x_i)$, maka\n",
    "\n",
    "$$I \\approx (b-a) f_{max} \\frac{N_{in}}{N}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "id": "7e18fa55",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "N = 10^4\n",
      "I approx ≈ 2.006535\n",
      "I analitik = 2\n",
      "error = 0.006535\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "a = 0\n",
    "b = np.pi\n",
    "f_max = max(f(x))\n",
    "N_in = len(x_in)\n",
    "N_total = len(x_point)\n",
    "I = (b - a) * f_max * (N_in / N_total)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'N = 10^4\\nI approx ≈ {I:.6f}\\nI analitik = 2\\nerror = {np.abs(2-I):.6f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5aadf975",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Metode Rata-Rata"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ede6bffa",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Ambil sampel $x_i ∼ U (a, b)$ lalu hitung rata-rata nilai fungsinya:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$I \\approx (b-a) \\langle f \\rangle = \\frac{b-a}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^N{f(x_i)}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "3fcd6eef",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "N = 10^4\n",
      "I approx ≈ 1.997831\n",
      "I analitik = 2\n",
      "error = 0.002169\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "I = (b - a) / N_total * sum(f(x_point))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'N = 10^4\\nI approx ≈ {I:.6f}\\nI analitik = 2\\nerror = {np.abs(2-I):.6f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "be964c54",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Integrasi dua dimensi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2652cdbc",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Hitung:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\int_0^\\pi \\int_0^\\pi \\sin{x} \\sin{y} dx dy$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Nilai analitik: 4"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 13,
   "id": "17872e60",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x = np.arange(0, np.pi, 0.01)\n",
    "y = np.arange(0, np.pi, 0.01)\n",
    "z = np.sin(x)*np.sin(y)\n",
    "\n",
    "fig = plt.figure()\n",
    "ax = fig.add_subplot(projection='3d')\n",
    "ax.plot(x, y, z, color='orange')\n",
    "plt.title('$f(x,y) = sin(x) sin(y) dx dy$')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a54cdbf3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Titik diambil di dalam kotak $[0, π]^2 \\times [0, 1]$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "cd8f21be",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x_point = []\n",
    "y_point = []\n",
    "z_point = []\n",
    "\n",
    "N = 10000\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(N):\n",
    "    x_point.append(np.random.uniform(0,np.pi))\n",
    "    y_point.append(np.random.uniform(0,np.pi))\n",
    "    z_point.append(np.random.uniform(0,1))\n",
    "\n",
    "fig = plt.figure()\n",
    "ax = fig.add_subplot(projection='3d')\n",
    "ax.scatter(x_point, y_point, z_point, s=1)\n",
    "ax.plot(x, y, z, color='orange', linewidth=3)\n",
    "plt.title('$N [0, π]^2 \\\\times [0, 1]$')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f0e194ca",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$N_{in}$ titik yang memenuhi $z_i < f(x_i, y_i)$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 15,
   "id": "b4774616",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "x_in = []\n",
    "y_in = []\n",
    "z_in = []\n",
    "\n",
    "def f(x, y):\n",
    "    return np.sin(x) * np.sin(y)\n",
    "\n",
    "for i in range(N):\n",
    "    if z_point[i] < f(x_point[i], y_point[i]):\n",
    "        x_in.append(x_point[i])\n",
    "        y_in.append(y_point[i])\n",
    "        z_in.append(z_point[i])\n",
    "\n",
    "fig = plt.figure()\n",
    "ax = fig.add_subplot(projection='3d')\n",
    "ax.scatter(x_in, y_in, z_in, s=1)\n",
    "ax.plot(x, y, f(x, y), color='orange')\n",
    "plt.title('$N_{in}: z_i < f(x_i, y_i)$')\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4e7881de",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Metode hit-or-miss"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "aa62ea8a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$I \\approx (b-a)^2 f_{max} \\frac{N_{in}}{N}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "d4437cdb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "N = 10^4\n",
      "I approx ≈ 3.990279\n",
      "I analitik = 4\n",
      "error = 0.009721\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "a = 0\n",
    "b = np.pi\n",
    "f_max = max(f(x, y))\n",
    "N_in = len(x_in)\n",
    "N_total = len(x_point)\n",
    "I = (b - a)**2 * f_max * (N_in / N_total)\n",
    "print(f'N = 10^4\\nI approx ≈ {I:.6f}\\nI analitik = 4\\nerror = {np.abs(4-I):.6f}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0303000a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Metode Rata-Rata"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e32a2f05",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$I \\approx \\frac{(b-a)^2}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^N{f(x_i)}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "id": "f91f73cb",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "N = 10^4\n",
      "I approx ≈ 3.991951\n",
      "I analitik = 4\n",
      "error = 0.008049\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "I = (b - a)**2 / N_total * sum(f(x_point, y_point))\n",
    "print(f'N = 10^4\\nI approx ≈ {I:.6f}\\nI analitik = 4\\nerror = {np.abs(4-I):.6f}')"
   ]
  }
 ],
